@startuml sequence-achat-billet-cas1-paiement
' ============================================================
' Diagramme de sequence : Achat d'un billet match
' PARTIE 1.bis/3 - Detail paiement E-Cash (402 vs 200)
' Scenario PFA - Ilyas Ait Maina (EMSI Maroc)
' Sources : code qui compile (ticket-service, payment-service)
' Regles : B.12 (debit E-Cash), verrous pessimistes
'          Flux achat global = sequence-achat-billet-cas1-visiteur.puml
' ============================================================

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FDF2F2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #B91C1C
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #D97706
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"

title Achat billet - Paiement E-Cash (cas 402 solde insuffisant vs 200 success)

participant ":TicketService\n:ticket-service"                          as TSV
participant ":PaymentClient\n:RestTemplate X-Internal-Secret"           as PCI
participant ":PaymentController\n:payment-service :8083"                as PAY
participant ":PaymentService\n:payment-service"                         as PSY
participant ":NotificationClient\n:RestTemplate X-Internal-Secret"      as NCI
participant ":NotificationService\n:notification-service :8086"        as NOT
actor "Adherent"                                                       as AH

== Preambule : billets crees en BDD, places debitees ==
note over TSV
  Vient de : sequence-achat-billet-cas1-visiteur.puml
  - INSERT tickets x quantity (status=PAID, qrCodeImage)
  - UPDATE sections SET available_seats -= qty
  - UPDATE events    SET sold_tickets += qty
  -> transaction ticket_db commit
  -> appel paiement ci-dessous
end note

TSV -> PCI : debitEcash(email, total, "WAC-TICKET-"+eventId)
activate PCI
PCI -> PAY : POST /api/payment/internal/debit\n              X-Internal-Secret\n              { email, amount, reference }
activate PAY
PAY -> PAY : isInternalCallAuthorized(secret) -> true
PAY -> PSY : internalDebit(email, amount, reference)
activate PSY

== Cas A - solde insuffisant (402 Payment Required) ==
alt [Solde E-Cash < montant]
  PSY -> PSY : SQL SELECT e_cash_accounts\n                 WHERE email=:e FOR UPDATE
  note right of PSY
    payment_db : verrou pessimiste 2s
    sur la ligne e_cash_accounts
    -> anti double-debit concurentiel
  end note
  PSY -> PSY : balance < amount
  PSY --> PAY : throw InsufficientFundsException
  deactivate PSY
  PAY --> PCI : 402 Payment Required\n                { error:"INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS",\n                  available, required }
  PCI --> TSV : 402 InsufficientFundsException
  deactivate PAY
  deactivate PCI

  note over TSV
    @Transactional -> ROLLBACK
    INSERT tickets + UPDATE sections/events
    -> placees liberees, aucun billet fantome.
    Le client n'a rien achete.
  end note

  TSV --> AH : 402 "Solde E-cash insuffisant (disponible : X DH)"
  note right of AH
    Cote front : BilletterieDetailComponent
    bandeau "Recharger votre E-Cash"
    (lien /profil/e-cash) + panier
    conserve pour re-essai apres recharge.
  end note

== Cas B - debit reussi (200 OK) ==
else [Solde E-Cash >= montant]
  PSY -> PSY : SQL SELECT e_cash_accounts\n                 WHERE email=:e FOR UPDATE
  PSY -> PSY : balance >= amount
  PSY -> PSY : SQL UPDATE e_cash_accounts\n                 SET balance = balance - amount
  PSY -> PSY : SQL INSERT transactions\n                 (type=DEBIT, ref, balanceAfter,\n                  amount, created_at)
  PSY --> PAY : TransactionResponse { ref, balanceAfter }
  deactivate PSY
  PAY --> PCI : 200 OK
  deactivate PAY
  PCI --> TSV : TransactionResponse { ref, balanceAfter }
  deactivate PCI

  note over TSV
    Paiement OK -> flux achat poursuit :
    - notifyUser() best-effort
    - 201 Created TicketResponse
    - Redirect /profil/billets
    (cf. fin de sequence-achat-billet-cas1-visiteur.puml)
  end note
end

note over TSV, NOT
  Garanties paiement (B.12) :
  --------------------------------------
  * Verrou pessimiste 2s sur e_cash_accounts (anti double-debit)
  * 402 dedie via InsufficientFundsException (mappe 402, pas 500)
  * ROLLBACK transactionnel : places liberees si KO
  * TransactionResponse.reference unique = tracabilite
  * Pas d'appel PSP externe (ECash = wallet interne)
  * Paiement carte = log-only (mock V1) -> pas de passage ici
end note

@enduml
